WEBVTT

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:10.332
Don't move!

00:03:16.228 --> 00:03:17.786
What's this?

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.161
We found him in the trunks

00:03:19.198 --> 00:03:21.257
a hundred footfalls
past Grove Yellow.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.324
Arms?

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:23.494
None, sir.

00:03:23.535 --> 00:03:25.230
These colors?

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:26.862
We didn't ask.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:30.237
He's no Krady beast, is he?

00:03:30.275 --> 00:03:34.302
No, sir, but he doesn't bear
Vori colors, either.

00:03:34.346 --> 00:03:36.780
Hmm... his glimpse
is too tame to be a Kradin.

00:03:36.815 --> 00:03:39.978
I hadn't fathomed that, sir.

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:41.987
Well, fathom it now.

00:03:42.087 --> 00:03:44.055
He's no nemesis, is he?

00:03:46.592 --> 00:03:47.991
I'm not certain what he is, sir.

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:49.892
Weren't you drilled
to fathom the nemesis?

00:03:49.928 --> 00:03:50.952
Yes, sir.

00:03:50.996 --> 00:03:53.362
And we abhor none
but the nemesis, do we?

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:55.264
No, sir.
None but the nemesis.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:56.733
Then set him loose.

00:03:58.237 --> 00:04:00.171
Didn't you hear, novice?

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:12.617
Thanks.

00:04:12.651 --> 00:04:14.084
Go take provisions.

00:04:19.124 --> 00:04:20.421
I'm sorry, sir...

00:04:20.459 --> 00:04:22.188
Go.

00:04:23.862 --> 00:04:25.955
I take it you're in charge here.

00:04:26.031 --> 00:04:28.761
Team Leader Brone,
Fourth Vori Defense Contingent.

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:31.201
Commander Chakotay
of the Starship Voyager.

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:39.704
Very sorry for my defenders.

00:04:39.745 --> 00:04:40.837
They're new to the clash

00:04:40.879 --> 00:04:42.813
and glimpse the nemesis
all around them.

00:04:42.848 --> 00:04:44.281
The clash?

00:04:44.316 --> 00:04:45.749
You're at war.

00:04:45.784 --> 00:04:47.615
You've strayed
into the fullness of it.

00:04:47.653 --> 00:04:49.848
That explains why my shuttle
came under fire.

00:04:49.888 --> 00:04:51.515
One of my defenders
glimpsed a vessel

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:52.615
falling in Grove Yellow.

00:04:52.658 --> 00:04:54.148
Must've been yours.

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:58.425
Why fly so close to this sphere?

00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:00.728
I was on a survey mission.

00:05:00.766 --> 00:05:02.461
I picked up traces
of omicron radiation

00:05:02.501 --> 00:05:04.867
in your atmosphere, so I
slowed down to take a look.

00:05:04.903 --> 00:05:07.531
As soon as I did that,
I came under attack.

00:05:07.573 --> 00:05:09.097
I lost helm control

00:05:09.141 --> 00:05:11.405
and had to make an emergency
transport to the surface.

00:05:11.443 --> 00:05:13.104
It'll be the Kradin
who fired at you.

00:05:13.145 --> 00:05:14.134
The Kradin?

00:05:14.179 --> 00:05:16.477
Our nemesis.

00:05:16.515 --> 00:05:18.415
I see.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:21.510
Well, I tried to explain that I
had no hostile intentions,

00:05:21.553 --> 00:05:22.815
but they just kept shooting.

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:25.380
The nemesis crave
supremacy in the air.

00:05:25.424 --> 00:05:27.949
They fire on any craft that
doesn't show Kradin colors.

00:05:28.026 --> 00:05:29.152
I tried to contact my ship,

00:05:29.194 --> 00:05:31.424
but my communicator's
not working.

00:05:31.463 --> 00:05:33.055
All dispatching
in the clash zone

00:05:33.098 --> 00:05:34.122
has been suppressed.

00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:36.760
I have to find my vessel.

00:05:36.802 --> 00:05:38.099
Maybe it's salvageable.

00:05:38.137 --> 00:05:39.434
That's little likely.

00:05:39.471 --> 00:05:41.939
We're ordered to cluster
with the Seventh Contingent

00:05:41.974 --> 00:05:42.941
two new lights from now.

00:05:42.975 --> 00:05:44.966
They'll have means
to signal your people.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.944
You can make the walk
with us to meet them.

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:49.675
I appreciate the offer,
but I can't wait two days.

00:05:49.715 --> 00:05:51.307
I have to find my vessel now.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.409
It wouldn't be sharp
to return to the trunks.

00:05:53.452 --> 00:05:55.784
The nemesis is everywhere there.

00:05:57.156 --> 00:05:59.522
Then I'll have to do my best
to steer clear of them.

00:06:00.626 --> 00:06:02.287
If your tactic won't change...

00:06:02.327 --> 00:06:04.625
It won't.

00:06:06.865 --> 00:06:09.060
It's sharper to wait
for the new light.

00:06:13.038 --> 00:06:15.165
Then I'll take
your advice and wait.

00:06:28.053 --> 00:06:29.987
Well done.

00:06:51.743 --> 00:06:53.438
Provisions?

00:06:56.915 --> 00:06:58.883
It's not so savory.

00:06:58.917 --> 00:07:00.942
Thanks.
I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:07:03.689 --> 00:07:05.589
They call me Rafin.

00:07:05.624 --> 00:07:06.716
Chakotay.

00:07:06.758 --> 00:07:08.191
Pleased to meet you.

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:11.390
In the trunks, di...

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:12.761
did you glimpse any?

00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:15.925
Any what?

00:07:15.968 --> 00:07:17.458
Krady beasts.

00:07:19.738 --> 00:07:21.103
No, I didn't.

00:07:21.139 --> 00:07:25.041
Rafin's never glimpsed
the face of the nemesis, either.

00:07:25.077 --> 00:07:27.045
Have you, Rafin?

00:07:27.079 --> 00:07:28.910
No.

00:07:31.216 --> 00:07:33.946
It's my first walk
in the clash zone.

00:07:33.986 --> 00:07:35.920
You'll glimpse them
in the soonafter.

00:07:37.189 --> 00:07:38.588
When you do, you'll fathom

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:41.149
there's no heart thumping
beneath their flesh.

00:07:47.199 --> 00:07:50.134
How many beasts will you send
to the Wayafter, Rafin?

00:07:50.168 --> 00:07:53.968
I... I couldn't say.

00:07:54.039 --> 00:07:55.563
Me, I'll nullify one

00:07:55.607 --> 00:07:58.337
for each brother and cousin
that I've lost.

00:07:59.878 --> 00:08:01.641
And then one more after.

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.308
True or not, my allies?

00:08:04.349 --> 00:08:06.442
True.
True.

00:08:07.786 --> 00:08:10.346
So I ask you again, Rafin.

00:08:10.389 --> 00:08:12.448
How many will you nullify?

00:08:12.491 --> 00:08:14.823
As man... as many as I'm able.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:20.928
You've got the trembles.

00:08:20.999 --> 00:08:24.059
If you don't wrestle
your trembles to rages, ally,

00:08:24.102 --> 00:08:26.662
the nemesis'll nullify you.

00:08:33.645 --> 00:08:35.374
This nemesis of yours...

00:08:35.414 --> 00:08:37.848
why do you call them beasts?

00:08:46.358 --> 00:08:48.758
It's told they all wear
the same horrid face.

00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:54.791
Their flesh...
is gnarled and blistery

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:56.858
like the rotting trunks.

00:08:58.503 --> 00:09:00.971
Their glimpses flame like fire.

00:09:03.375 --> 00:09:06.208
And if you dare near enough,
their breath stinks of muck.

00:09:06.244 --> 00:09:09.042
You know, sometimes
people say terrible things

00:09:09.081 --> 00:09:10.275
about their enemies,

00:09:10.315 --> 00:09:12.715
to make them seem worse
than they really are.

00:09:12.751 --> 00:09:15.413
There might be some
young Kradin soldier out there

00:09:15.454 --> 00:09:17.888
who's more afraid of you
than you are of him.

00:09:20.025 --> 00:09:22.721
Nemesis wasn't scared
to fume my village...

00:09:22.761 --> 00:09:26.527
nor scared to nullify my cousins
and brothers in their sleep.

00:09:29.134 --> 00:09:32.399
And my old mother's mother,
too...

00:09:32.437 --> 00:09:35.873
who never told an unkind word,
nor nullified an insect

00:09:35.907 --> 00:09:38.603
in all her days and nights
on this sphere.

00:09:38.643 --> 00:09:40.702
That's pretty rough.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.408
And who but a Krady beast

00:09:43.448 --> 00:09:46.508
would leave the nullified bodies
of mine and ours upturned...

00:09:46.551 --> 00:09:50.681
so they'll never descend
to the gloried Wayafter.

00:09:50.722 --> 00:09:52.781
What do you mean by "upturned"?

00:09:52.824 --> 00:09:54.121
Which of you will walk
with Chakotay

00:09:54.159 --> 00:09:55.751
to find his craft
when the new light comes?

00:09:55.827 --> 00:09:59.627
I appreciate the offer,
but I'll be fine on my own.

00:09:59.664 --> 00:10:02.155
You don't fathom the trunks
and you don't carry arms.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.134
One of my defenders
will walk with you.

00:10:04.169 --> 00:10:05.737
Which will it be?

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:07.895
You, Rafin?

00:10:07.939 --> 00:10:10.407
S-Sir, I... I...

00:10:10.441 --> 00:10:12.841
I'll walk with the stranger,
sir.

00:10:12.877 --> 00:10:16.813
If any beast comes to clash,
I'll nullify the beast.

00:10:16.848 --> 00:10:18.247
Well told, Namon.

00:10:18.282 --> 00:10:20.307
Now close your glimpses,
Defenders...

00:10:20.351 --> 00:10:23.343
and dream of your sisters
and mothers.

00:10:40.371 --> 00:10:42.965
Have you never nullified
another, stranger?

00:10:43.007 --> 00:10:46.602
Killing's the worst thing
I've ever had to do.

00:10:46.644 --> 00:10:48.839
Then the nemesis you nullified

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:51.678
wasn't half so beastly
as the Kradin.

00:10:51.716 --> 00:10:54.014
Maybe not.

00:10:54.051 --> 00:10:57.384
In their glimpses,
we're less than nothing.

00:10:57.421 --> 00:11:00.720
They flame our homes,
take our plantings...

00:11:00.758 --> 00:11:03.818
make playthings of our sisters.

00:11:03.861 --> 00:11:04.828
If you were a Vori,

00:11:04.862 --> 00:11:07.057
you'd crave to drive them
from this sphere

00:11:07.098 --> 00:11:08.759
just as I do.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:10.427
Maybe I would

00:11:10.468 --> 00:11:13.460
if they did things like that
to the people I loved.

00:11:13.504 --> 00:11:16.337
But on the sphere I come from,

00:11:16.374 --> 00:11:20.140
we try to find other ways
to resolve differences...

00:11:20.178 --> 00:11:23.147
peaceful solutions,
negotiations.

00:11:25.149 --> 00:11:27.709
You don't fathom the nemesis.

00:11:27.752 --> 00:11:31.210
No. I suppose I don't.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:37.559
Beg the Power you believe in
that you never will.

00:11:46.971 --> 00:11:48.404
The light will be old soon.

00:11:48.439 --> 00:11:50.999
We'd be sharp to cluster
with the others.

00:11:51.042 --> 00:11:52.009
In a few minutes.

00:11:52.043 --> 00:11:53.476
We should be getting close.

00:11:53.511 --> 00:11:56.139
You'd be sharp
to do my tellings.

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.148
Go back if you want to.

00:11:58.182 --> 00:11:59.649
I've got to keep looking.

00:11:59.684 --> 00:12:01.276
No, wait.

00:12:03.287 --> 00:12:05.448
I pledged to walk with you.

00:12:07.291 --> 00:12:08.519
Glimpse there.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:18.227
Doesn't look like there's
much left of my shuttle.

00:12:18.269 --> 00:12:20.134
You'll have to make
the walk with us

00:12:20.171 --> 00:12:21.536
to the Seventh Contingent.

00:12:28.379 --> 00:12:30.244
Don't make me kill you!

00:12:45.396 --> 00:12:46.761
How is he?

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:51.563
Nullified.

00:12:59.877 --> 00:13:02.846
We beg peace from the Power
who made us Vori

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:09.581
and we commend our brother,
Namon, to the gloried Wayafter.

00:13:43.521 --> 00:13:44.886
What's this?

00:13:44.922 --> 00:13:46.981
Namon's coverings.

00:13:47.058 --> 00:13:50.323
Shouldn't they go to his family
or someone he was close to?

00:13:50.361 --> 00:13:52.192
It's a long walk
to the clustermark.

00:13:52.229 --> 00:13:54.561
It's sharper to blend
with the trunks.

00:13:54.598 --> 00:13:57.465
Your fleet colors will
get us all nullified.

00:14:01.205 --> 00:14:03.503
I'm sorry about
what happened to Namon.

00:14:03.541 --> 00:14:06.374
The nemesis has nullified
mine and ours in the before

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:09.072
and will in the now.

00:14:09.113 --> 00:14:12.742
But in the soonafter...

00:14:12.783 --> 00:14:16.048
we'll send them flying
from this sphere

00:14:16.087 --> 00:14:18.920
and go back to our sisters
and mothers.

00:14:21.492 --> 00:14:23.357
Take it.

00:14:23.394 --> 00:14:25.362
This isn't my war.

00:14:25.396 --> 00:14:26.954
I'm not planning
to shoot anybody.

00:14:27.031 --> 00:14:29.431
If we greet the nemesis
in the trunks, you'll fire

00:14:29.467 --> 00:14:30.661
like the rest.

00:14:31.769 --> 00:14:33.259
As long as you're with us,

00:14:33.304 --> 00:14:34.896
you do my tellings, fathom?

00:14:39.377 --> 00:14:40.901
Fathom.

00:14:42.446 --> 00:14:43.470
Rafin.

00:14:43.514 --> 00:14:45.482
Yes, sir?

00:14:45.516 --> 00:14:48.610
Drill Chakotay
to fire Vori arms.

00:14:54.892 --> 00:14:56.086
Now you.

00:15:04.969 --> 00:15:06.834
Your glimpse is too low.

00:15:06.871 --> 00:15:10.307
With these arms, it's sharper
to aim higher than the mark.

00:15:17.248 --> 00:15:18.738
You're good.

00:15:18.783 --> 00:15:21.183
Don't mock me.

00:15:21.218 --> 00:15:23.152
I was paying you a compliment.

00:15:23.187 --> 00:15:25.849
It is one matter
to fire at clay marks,

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:28.859
but much another
to nullify the nemesis.

00:15:28.893 --> 00:15:32.522
That's what Namon told,
and he told the truth

00:15:32.563 --> 00:15:34.622
before he went
to the gloried Wayafter.

00:15:34.665 --> 00:15:36.132
He was right.

00:15:36.167 --> 00:15:37.600
Killing's not easy.

00:15:40.104 --> 00:15:41.969
Risking my own days and nights

00:15:42.073 --> 00:15:43.631
to drive the nemesis
from our sphere...

00:15:45.976 --> 00:15:48.968
that should be as easy
as a long sleep.

00:15:49.046 --> 00:15:51.640
Who taught you that?

00:15:51.682 --> 00:15:55.880
My brothers and uncles
who were in the clash...

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:58.753
Brone, my driller...

00:16:02.093 --> 00:16:05.893
and Namon, my ally...

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:08.524
who was nullified because of me.

00:16:10.868 --> 00:16:13.029
You think it's your
fault that Namon died?

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:14.537
If I didn't have
the coward's trembles,

00:16:14.572 --> 00:16:16.631
I would have walked with you
in the trunks...

00:16:16.674 --> 00:16:20.872
and it would be me and not he
who went to the Wayafter.

00:16:20.911 --> 00:16:22.936
You weren't the one
who pulled the trigger, Rafin,

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:26.108
and there's no shame
in being afraid of fighting.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.141
Having the trembles is natural.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.910
How do you fathom that?

00:16:30.955 --> 00:16:32.650
Because I've been
in battle before,

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:34.521
fighting to free my people

00:16:34.558 --> 00:16:37.049
from a nemesis called
the Cardassians.

00:16:38.929 --> 00:16:41.090
These Cardassians...

00:16:41.132 --> 00:16:43.600
were they beasts?

00:16:43.634 --> 00:16:46.899
Let's just say they
weren't very friendly.

00:16:46.937 --> 00:16:48.905
The point is,

00:16:48.939 --> 00:16:51.407
even though I believed
in what we were doing,

00:16:51.442 --> 00:16:53.876
I always felt fear
before a fight.

00:16:53.911 --> 00:16:57.813
But you wrestled your trembles
to rages, didn't you?

00:16:59.617 --> 00:17:01.414
I guess I did,

00:17:01.452 --> 00:17:02.476
but that doesn't mean...

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:04.545
I was told to drill you,
Chakotay,

00:17:04.588 --> 00:17:07.489
but it's you who've drilled me...

00:17:07.525 --> 00:17:10.255
drilled me to fathom the rages.

00:17:50.867 --> 00:17:52.391
Brone.

00:17:52.435 --> 00:17:53.663
What is it?

00:17:53.703 --> 00:17:54.829
I don't know.

00:18:05.715 --> 00:18:07.706
Neck-strapped and upturned.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.481
Left to be cooked by the glare.

00:18:11.521 --> 00:18:13.148
He's one of yours?

00:18:13.189 --> 00:18:15.180
By his coverings,
he's of the Seventh Contingent.

00:18:15.224 --> 00:18:16.919
Likely a scoutwalker.

00:18:16.959 --> 00:18:19.928
Desecrated by the Kradin.

00:18:19.962 --> 00:18:22.658
He'll never turn his face
to the Wayafter.

00:18:22.698 --> 00:18:24.893
We're 300 footfalls
from the clustermark.

00:18:24.934 --> 00:18:26.595
Signal the Seventh.

00:18:33.476 --> 00:18:35.410
Again.

00:18:39.315 --> 00:18:40.782
Why don't they answer?

00:18:40.816 --> 00:18:42.943
Is it possible they moved
their camp for some reason?

00:18:43.019 --> 00:18:44.111
Little likely.

00:18:44.153 --> 00:18:45.586
You two fastwalk
to the clustermark

00:18:45.621 --> 00:18:46.645
and glimpse what you can.

00:18:46.689 --> 00:18:47.656
Sir.

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:48.884
What?

00:18:48.925 --> 00:18:50.290
Let me go.

00:18:52.862 --> 00:18:54.591
Well told, novice.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.622
Keep your top low
and your glimpse wide.

00:19:14.483 --> 00:19:15.472
Sir!

00:19:17.853 --> 00:19:20.151
What have you glimpsed?

00:19:20.189 --> 00:19:24.216
The Seventh Contingent, sir,
nullified.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.490
What? All of them?

00:19:26.529 --> 00:19:28.258
At least 20 defenders

00:19:28.297 --> 00:19:31.528
and that's not
the whole terrible of it.

00:19:31.567 --> 00:19:34.035
They're all...

00:19:35.471 --> 00:19:37.268
they're all...

00:19:37.306 --> 00:19:39.001
Tell it, Rafin.
They're all how?

00:19:40.076 --> 00:19:41.873
Like him, sir.

00:19:41.911 --> 00:19:44.072
Upturned.

00:19:44.113 --> 00:19:46.274
Staked to the dirt and upturned.

00:19:46.315 --> 00:19:48.840
Those motherless Krady beasts.

00:19:52.421 --> 00:19:55.151
Do you glimpse the fullness
of it now, stranger?

00:19:56.459 --> 00:19:59.223
Yes. I think I do.

00:19:59.261 --> 00:20:02.321
Now you fathom why we name
them beasts and not men.

00:20:04.333 --> 00:20:05.493
I'm sorry.

00:20:06.836 --> 00:20:10.135
We're much more than sorry...

00:20:10.172 --> 00:20:12.072
aren't we, Defenders?

00:20:12.108 --> 00:20:13.598
Yes, sir!

00:20:13.643 --> 00:20:16.771
The nemesis
wants your plantings.

00:20:16.812 --> 00:20:19.110
True.

00:20:19.148 --> 00:20:22.311
He wants your homes.

00:20:22.351 --> 00:20:26.310
He wants your sisters,

00:20:26.355 --> 00:20:28.983
but does it suffice him
to nullify you?

00:20:29.058 --> 00:20:29.990
No!

00:20:30.059 --> 00:20:32.323
No. He craves to shame you,

00:20:32.361 --> 00:20:35.797
mock you, keep you from
the gloried Wayafter!

00:20:35.831 --> 00:20:37.423
We're wearied of it,
aren't we?

00:20:37.466 --> 00:20:38.490
Yes, sir!

00:20:38.534 --> 00:20:40.934
We're wrestled to the rages
for it, aren't we?!

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:41.937
Yes, sir!

00:20:41.971 --> 00:20:43.996
And we're not going
to swallow it...

00:20:44.106 --> 00:20:47.303
not in the now,
or in the soonafter!

00:20:50.579 --> 00:20:52.410
Assault!

00:20:52.448 --> 00:20:55.747
Sly yourselves and fire back!

00:21:19.475 --> 00:21:20.635
Motherless beasts!

00:21:20.676 --> 00:21:22.473
Rafin, no! Stay down!

00:21:22.511 --> 00:21:24.741
I'll nullify you all!

00:21:30.252 --> 00:21:31.219
Hold on.

00:21:31.253 --> 00:21:33.244
I'm going to get you
out of here.

00:21:42.098 --> 00:21:43.463
Please...

00:21:43.499 --> 00:21:46.991
turn my face to the... Wayafter.

00:22:42.258 --> 00:22:43.885
A defender.

00:22:43.926 --> 00:22:45.188
Mark, neighbors.

00:22:45.227 --> 00:22:47.127
A defender!

00:22:50.399 --> 00:22:53.493
Welcome to Larhana settlement,
gloried defender.

00:22:53.536 --> 00:22:56.130
You're brightly greeted.

00:23:04.213 --> 00:23:07.944
Captain's Log, Stardate 51082.4.

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:10.348
After searching
for more than two days,

00:23:10.386 --> 00:23:12.479
we've finally located
what's left

00:23:12.521 --> 00:23:14.546
of Commander Chakotay's shuttle.

00:23:14.590 --> 00:23:16.182
I can only hope the Commander

00:23:16.225 --> 00:23:18.887
has fared better
than his vessel.

00:23:18.928 --> 00:23:20.896
According to the Ambassador,
Commander Chakotay's

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:23.694
shuttle was hit by enemy fire
and crash-landed

00:23:23.732 --> 00:23:25.359
somewhere
on the southernmost continent.

00:23:25.401 --> 00:23:26.891
Right in the middle
of the war zone.

00:23:26.936 --> 00:23:27.903
I'm afraid so.

00:23:27.937 --> 00:23:29.097
Can we get a lock on him?

00:23:29.138 --> 00:23:31.333
There's too much atmospheric
radiation from weapons fire.

00:23:31.373 --> 00:23:32.567
We can't scan the surface.

00:23:32.608 --> 00:23:34.200
Which means, we don't know
if he's still alive.

00:23:34.243 --> 00:23:35.733
Why don't we assume
that he still is?

00:23:35.778 --> 00:23:36.972
I should have gone with him.

00:23:37.012 --> 00:23:37.979
It's not your fault, Tom.

00:23:38.013 --> 00:23:39.207
We couldn't
have anticipated this.

00:23:39.248 --> 00:23:40.237
What we've got to do now

00:23:40.282 --> 00:23:41.510
is figure out
how to deal with it.

00:23:41.550 --> 00:23:43.541
B'Elanna, try to modify
the scanners,

00:23:43.586 --> 00:23:45.247
cut through the interference.

00:23:45.287 --> 00:23:46.254
Aye, Captain.

00:23:46.288 --> 00:23:48.848
Neelix, what do you know
about this war?

00:23:48.891 --> 00:23:50.324
It's vicious.

00:23:50.359 --> 00:23:53.089
Ambassador Treen's people
have been defending themselves

00:23:53.128 --> 00:23:54.993
against a particularly
savage aggressor

00:23:55.064 --> 00:23:56.224
for more than a decade.

00:23:56.265 --> 00:23:58.460
Is the Ambassador willing
to help us find Chakotay?

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:01.196
He's willing,
but he may not be able.

00:24:01.237 --> 00:24:03.228
His resources
are extremely limited

00:24:03.272 --> 00:24:05.297
and the situation
on the surface is chaotic.

00:24:05.341 --> 00:24:06.433
But he's assured me

00:24:06.475 --> 00:24:08.238
that if his troops
do find Chakotay,

00:24:08.277 --> 00:24:09.904
he'll receive medical attention

00:24:09.945 --> 00:24:12.106
and be transported
to the nearest command post.

00:24:12.147 --> 00:24:13.341
Let's hope he doesn't meet up

00:24:13.382 --> 00:24:14.940
with these "savage
aggressors" first.

00:24:14.984 --> 00:24:16.042
Captain, let me lead

00:24:16.085 --> 00:24:17.609
a team down there
and bring him back.

00:24:17.653 --> 00:24:18.950
I understand how you feel, Tom,

00:24:18.988 --> 00:24:20.717
but let's take it
one step at a time.

00:24:20.756 --> 00:24:22.781
Tuvok, recontact
Ambassador Treen.

00:24:22.825 --> 00:24:25.089
Ask for any tactical support
he's willing to provide...

00:24:25.127 --> 00:24:27.595
maps, weapons analyses,
intelligence reports.

00:24:27.630 --> 00:24:30.565
Before I risk
anyone else's life,

00:24:30.599 --> 00:24:31.566
I want to know exactly

00:24:31.600 --> 00:24:32.999
what we're getting
ourselves into.

00:24:36.305 --> 00:24:39.763
By your coverings,
you're a novice defender.

00:24:39.808 --> 00:24:42.242
Do I tell the truth?

00:24:42.278 --> 00:24:45.076
Listen, there's been
a misunderstanding.

00:24:45.114 --> 00:24:46.741
I'm not a defender.

00:24:46.782 --> 00:24:48.750
My shuttle was shot down
by the Kradin

00:24:48.784 --> 00:24:50.649
and I landed in the clash zone.

00:24:50.686 --> 00:24:52.779
I met up
with one of your patrols.

00:24:52.821 --> 00:24:54.254
They gave me this uniform.

00:24:54.290 --> 00:24:55.518
Which Contingent?

00:24:55.557 --> 00:24:57.525
The Fourth.

00:24:57.559 --> 00:24:59.652
The Fourth?

00:24:59.695 --> 00:25:01.322
They're sturdy clashers.

00:25:01.363 --> 00:25:04.355
Tell us...
did you and your allies

00:25:04.400 --> 00:25:07.164
drive the nemesis
from the trunks?

00:25:07.202 --> 00:25:09.102
We put up a brave fight.

00:25:09.138 --> 00:25:13.336
Then you're a gloried defender
even if you claim not to be.

00:25:13.375 --> 00:25:15.468
Marna tells the truth, Chakotay.

00:25:15.511 --> 00:25:18.378
You are welcome
among my neighbors.

00:25:18.414 --> 00:25:20.211
Thank you.

00:25:20.249 --> 00:25:22.774
That's very kind.

00:25:22.818 --> 00:25:24.683
Do you crave anything more?

00:25:24.720 --> 00:25:26.779
Drink? Warm coverings?

00:25:26.822 --> 00:25:29.450
What I really need is
some communications equipment

00:25:29.491 --> 00:25:30.685
to contact my crew.

00:25:30.726 --> 00:25:33.354
We have no means
to signal your people.

00:25:33.395 --> 00:25:35.955
The Kradin drove us
from our homes

00:25:36.065 --> 00:25:38.795
and plantings and took
all the machinery we had.

00:25:38.834 --> 00:25:40.495
Do you know
where I might find someplace

00:25:40.536 --> 00:25:41.901
with communications equipment?

00:25:43.639 --> 00:25:44.970
The Restock Unit.

00:25:45.007 --> 00:25:46.338
Can you tell me
how to get there?

00:25:46.375 --> 00:25:49.242
It's not very near...
at least 10,000 footfalls

00:25:49.278 --> 00:25:50.973
through the thick
of the trunks.

00:25:51.080 --> 00:25:53.446
Then I'd better get started.

00:25:54.915 --> 00:25:56.644
The new light is coming.

00:25:56.683 --> 00:25:57.707
Rest till then.

00:25:57.751 --> 00:25:59.218
Yes, please, Chakotay.

00:25:59.253 --> 00:26:01.221
Rest until the new light.

00:26:03.557 --> 00:26:05.548
I think I will.

00:26:08.762 --> 00:26:10.252
Come, neighbors.

00:26:10.297 --> 00:26:12.857
Let's give Defender Chakotay
some quiet.

00:26:33.654 --> 00:26:36.054
I wanted to know
if you crave more.

00:26:39.726 --> 00:26:41.193
No, thank you.

00:26:41.228 --> 00:26:43.526
Oh.

00:26:43.564 --> 00:26:45.395
But it was delicious.

00:26:47.067 --> 00:26:48.762
And the blossoms?

00:26:48.802 --> 00:26:49.962
Do you like them?

00:26:50.003 --> 00:26:52.233
I planted them myself.

00:26:52.272 --> 00:26:54.297
They're very pretty.

00:26:55.843 --> 00:26:57.470
I've heard tellings
that the Kradin

00:26:57.511 --> 00:26:59.809
leave our nullied defenders
upturned.

00:26:59.847 --> 00:27:01.815
Is it true?

00:27:03.283 --> 00:27:04.750
You can tell me.

00:27:04.785 --> 00:27:08.653
Penno says I'm too small
to be told, but I'm not.

00:27:08.689 --> 00:27:12.147
It's true the Kradin
don't respect your beliefs.

00:27:12.192 --> 00:27:13.784
The Kradin are beasty.

00:27:13.827 --> 00:27:16.455
I don't fathom
why they flamed our homes

00:27:16.496 --> 00:27:18.157
nor why they crave
to nully us all.

00:27:18.198 --> 00:27:19.563
I don't, either.

00:27:19.600 --> 00:27:22.330
We never took their plantings.

00:27:22.369 --> 00:27:24.894
We never nullied their brothers.

00:27:24.938 --> 00:27:26.735
So why do they hate us?

00:27:26.773 --> 00:27:28.468
I wish I could tell you.

00:27:28.508 --> 00:27:31.477
Hate's not something
I understand very well.

00:27:34.047 --> 00:27:36.345
My brother's a defender, too.

00:27:36.383 --> 00:27:37.577
Really?

00:27:37.618 --> 00:27:40.382
He left for the clash
two plantings before.

00:27:40.420 --> 00:27:43.719
I was much smaller then.

00:27:43.757 --> 00:27:49.195
He was sturdy and pleasing
to glimpse in his colors.

00:27:49.229 --> 00:27:51.789
Like you.

00:27:53.567 --> 00:27:54.795
Maybe you've glimpsed him.

00:27:54.835 --> 00:27:56.325
He's called Daryo.

00:27:56.370 --> 00:27:58.930
There are
a lot of soldiers in the war.

00:27:58.972 --> 00:28:00.837
I only met a few of them.

00:28:00.874 --> 00:28:01.932
He's a team leader

00:28:01.975 --> 00:28:03.966
of the Seventh
Defense Contingent.

00:28:04.978 --> 00:28:06.775
The Seventh?

00:28:06.813 --> 00:28:09.179
Are you sure
he was with the Seventh?

00:28:09.216 --> 00:28:11.241
They're very sturdy
in the clash.

00:28:11.285 --> 00:28:13.276
Have you heard of them?

00:28:14.521 --> 00:28:15.488
The patrol I was with

00:28:15.522 --> 00:28:17.012
was supposed
to rendezvous with them.

00:28:17.057 --> 00:28:18.046
Why didn't you?

00:28:18.091 --> 00:28:19.683
You would have glimpsed him.

00:28:21.128 --> 00:28:22.891
We were ambushed
before we had the chance.

00:28:22.930 --> 00:28:25.524
But when you go back
to the clash

00:28:25.565 --> 00:28:27.931
likely you'll glimpse
Daryo then.

00:28:28.001 --> 00:28:30.492
You could take a letter to him.

00:28:30.537 --> 00:28:33.301
I'm not going back
to the clash zone.

00:28:33.340 --> 00:28:35.365
I've got to get
to the Restock Unit

00:28:35.409 --> 00:28:36.876
so I can contact my ship.

00:28:36.910 --> 00:28:39.435
Then you can bring my letter
to the Restock Unit.

00:28:39.479 --> 00:28:42.175
Likely some defender there
can take it to Daryo.

00:28:42.215 --> 00:28:43.910
Will you do it?

00:28:43.951 --> 00:28:45.816
Please?

00:28:49.489 --> 00:28:52.049
I'll go write it now
before the new light comes.

00:29:04.972 --> 00:29:06.371
I wish you a good day.

00:29:06.406 --> 00:29:07.600
Thank you.

00:29:07.641 --> 00:29:10.474
Provisions for your long walk.

00:29:10.510 --> 00:29:13.001
Walk well, Defender Chakotay.

00:29:13.046 --> 00:29:14.570
Thank you both.

00:29:14.614 --> 00:29:17.139
You've all been very kind.

00:29:21.288 --> 00:29:22.778
Writings for my brother.

00:29:22.823 --> 00:29:24.916
You'll be sure he gets them?

00:29:24.992 --> 00:29:27.051
I'll do my best.

00:29:27.094 --> 00:29:29.085
Your best will be enough.

00:29:29.129 --> 00:29:32.929
The pretty smell of the blossoms
will hold the nemesis far away.

00:29:35.068 --> 00:29:36.865
Then you'd better
keep one for yourself.

00:30:28.655 --> 00:30:29.747
Father!

00:30:48.208 --> 00:30:51.507
Offer no opposition
or you'll be nullified.

00:31:07.293 --> 00:31:10.353
No evidence of cellular residue
on the shuttle wreckage,

00:31:10.396 --> 00:31:13.194
so there's a chance
Chakotay survived the crash.

00:31:13.232 --> 00:31:14.824
Well, unfortunately,
the wreckage was found

00:31:14.867 --> 00:31:16.300
inside enemy territory.

00:31:16.335 --> 00:31:17.632
So there is also a chance

00:31:17.670 --> 00:31:20.366
he's been captured
or killed by the nemesis.

00:31:20.406 --> 00:31:22.704
There you go looking
on the bright side again, Tuvok.

00:31:23.709 --> 00:31:25.438
What's this "nemesis"?

00:31:25.478 --> 00:31:26.968
It is the term
Ambassador Treen's people

00:31:27.013 --> 00:31:28.275
use to identify their enemy.

00:31:28.314 --> 00:31:29.508
Apparently, they're vicious.

00:31:29.549 --> 00:31:31.278
They shoot without warning,

00:31:31.317 --> 00:31:34.377
use biochemical weapons,
routinely massacre civilians.

00:31:34.420 --> 00:31:36.445
If we run into them,
it's safe to say

00:31:36.489 --> 00:31:38.389
they won't be hanging out
a welcome sign.

00:31:39.459 --> 00:31:41.427
I want a team on the surface
as soon as possible.

00:31:41.461 --> 00:31:42.428
I was hoping you'd say that.

00:31:42.462 --> 00:31:43.429
Tuvok, let's get moving.

00:31:43.463 --> 00:31:44.760
I must caution you both.

00:31:44.797 --> 00:31:46.822
My tactical analysis
does not bode well

00:31:46.866 --> 00:31:48.663
for the success
of such a mission.

00:31:48.701 --> 00:31:50.635
Given the situation
in the battle zone,

00:31:50.670 --> 00:31:52.729
there is
a very high probability

00:31:52.772 --> 00:31:55.240
that an away team
will sustain heavy casualties.

00:31:55.274 --> 00:31:58.004
Are you saying we should
just abandon Chakotay?

00:31:58.044 --> 00:31:59.170
On the contrary.

00:31:59.212 --> 00:32:01.305
I suppose you've come up
with an alternative plan?

00:32:01.347 --> 00:32:02.314
Indeed.

00:32:02.348 --> 00:32:04.213
I have concluded
that the least risky

00:32:04.250 --> 00:32:06.514
course of action is for
a single crew member

00:32:06.552 --> 00:32:07.883
to make the infiltration,

00:32:07.920 --> 00:32:09.820
accompanied by a commando unit

00:32:09.856 --> 00:32:11.824
that Ambassador Treen
has agreed to provide.

00:32:11.858 --> 00:32:14.759
Fine with me.
When do I leave?

00:32:14.794 --> 00:32:18.355
Something tells me that's
not what Tuvok has in mind.

00:32:18.397 --> 00:32:20.524
Naturally, I am
the logical person

00:32:20.566 --> 00:32:21.965
to carry out this mission.

00:32:23.736 --> 00:32:25.328
Naturally.

00:32:31.644 --> 00:32:32.611
Get down there!

00:32:32.645 --> 00:32:33.839
Chakotay!

00:32:37.984 --> 00:32:39.747
I heard the explosions.

00:32:39.785 --> 00:32:41.980
I came back to help.

00:32:42.021 --> 00:32:44.581
What did the Kradin do to you?

00:32:46.392 --> 00:32:48.121
They interrogated me.

00:32:51.197 --> 00:32:52.687
Where's your grandfather?

00:32:52.732 --> 00:32:54.222
I don't know.

00:32:54.267 --> 00:32:57.430
He's very gray,
and his heart's not sturdy.

00:32:57.470 --> 00:32:59.529
He needs me to tend him.

00:33:01.474 --> 00:33:02.964
You!

00:33:06.179 --> 00:33:08.909
You! I want to talk
to your superior!

00:33:10.216 --> 00:33:11.205
Hey!

00:33:11.250 --> 00:33:12.808
I'm talking to you.
I want to know

00:33:12.852 --> 00:33:14.683
what you've done
with this girl's grandfather.

00:33:14.720 --> 00:33:15.709
He's old and needs medical...

00:33:16.589 --> 00:33:18.318
Chakotay!

00:33:20.993 --> 00:33:22.893
Penno always tells
it'll be brighter

00:33:22.929 --> 00:33:24.328
when the new light comes.

00:33:26.666 --> 00:33:28.361
Your grandfather is a wise man.

00:33:38.444 --> 00:33:40.207
That's right.

00:33:40.246 --> 00:33:41.770
Now get some sleep.

00:33:41.814 --> 00:33:43.839
You'll tend me, won't you?

00:33:43.883 --> 00:33:45.942
No matter what comes
in the soonafter?

00:33:48.955 --> 00:33:50.479
Close your glimpses...

00:33:52.592 --> 00:33:54.617
and dream
of your gloried brother.

00:34:11.410 --> 00:34:12.377
Move along, Vori.

00:34:12.411 --> 00:34:13.400
Don't shoot.

00:34:22.622 --> 00:34:24.351
We're coming.

00:34:25.524 --> 00:34:26.821
Move along!

00:34:31.364 --> 00:34:32.524
Where are they taking them?

00:34:32.565 --> 00:34:33.532
I don't know.

00:34:33.566 --> 00:34:34.897
They'll be fastwalked

00:34:34.934 --> 00:34:36.902
to the extermination facility.

00:34:36.936 --> 00:34:37.903
Why?

00:34:37.937 --> 00:34:39.234
Because they're gray

00:34:39.272 --> 00:34:40.569
and too long-lived

00:34:40.606 --> 00:34:42.972
and the Kradin think them
unfit for toiling.

00:34:43.075 --> 00:34:45.373
They won't make good servers,
like us.

00:34:45.411 --> 00:34:46.844
Penno!

00:34:48.247 --> 00:34:49.714
Penno!

00:34:49.749 --> 00:34:50.738
Karya!

00:34:50.783 --> 00:34:52.410
Where are they taking you?

00:34:52.451 --> 00:34:55.147
Be sturdy,
my daughter's daughter.

00:34:55.187 --> 00:34:56.916
Who's going to tend you?

00:34:56.956 --> 00:35:00.983
We'll glimpse each other again
in the Wayafter.

00:35:01.027 --> 00:35:02.517
- Set him loose!
- Karya!

00:35:02.561 --> 00:35:04.324
Set him loose!

00:35:04.363 --> 00:35:05.830
Be still.

00:35:05.865 --> 00:35:07.025
Keep your hands off her!

00:35:08.034 --> 00:35:09.296
Don't touch her!

00:35:10.136 --> 00:35:11.125
Halt!

00:35:14.040 --> 00:35:15.837
What's the matter, pretty one?

00:35:15.875 --> 00:35:17.365
Set my mother's father loose!

00:35:17.410 --> 00:35:19.935
Is that the man you mean?

00:35:19.979 --> 00:35:22.539
No! Karya!

00:35:22.581 --> 00:35:24.344
Please!

00:35:24.383 --> 00:35:25.873
Set him loose!

00:35:25.918 --> 00:35:29.615
You don't want to see him
suffer, do you, pretty one?

00:35:29.655 --> 00:35:30.849
No.

00:35:30.890 --> 00:35:31.948
Don't worry.

00:35:31.991 --> 00:35:34.255
The old Vori's suffering'll
be over soon enough.

00:35:34.293 --> 00:35:35.385
No!

00:35:35.428 --> 00:35:37.089
Penno!

00:35:37.129 --> 00:35:38.619
Take this screeching waif

00:35:38.664 --> 00:35:40.495
to the extermination
facility.

00:35:40.533 --> 00:35:44.264
No. Chakotay.
Set me loose!

00:35:44.303 --> 00:35:45.827
Chakotay, help me!

00:35:50.242 --> 00:35:52.733
You motherless beast!

00:36:03.155 --> 00:36:04.588
Are Ambassador Treen
and his soldiers

00:36:04.623 --> 00:36:05.590
ready to beam aboard?

00:36:05.624 --> 00:36:06.682
Aye, Captain.

00:36:06.726 --> 00:36:07.715
Energize.

00:36:11.530 --> 00:36:13.725
Welcome aboard, Ambassador.

00:36:13.766 --> 00:36:16.326
Thank you for agreeing
to help us find our crewman.

00:36:16.369 --> 00:36:18.837
Your thanks
are unnecessary, Captain.

00:36:18.871 --> 00:36:22.830
Any victim of our
bloodthirsty nemesis the Vori

00:36:22.875 --> 00:36:26.436
will always find friends
among the Kradin people.

00:36:40.493 --> 00:36:42.586
Chakotay...

00:36:42.628 --> 00:36:44.493
calm now.

00:36:44.530 --> 00:36:46.225
I'll set you loose.

00:36:51.670 --> 00:36:53.638
Sorry to leave you
upturned so long...

00:36:56.108 --> 00:36:57.735
but I had to shroud
myself in the trunks

00:36:57.777 --> 00:36:58.937
till the Kradin walked on.

00:37:12.958 --> 00:37:16.121
The villagers
from Larhana settlement?

00:37:16.162 --> 00:37:17.925
They were fastwalked
through the trunks.

00:37:18.030 --> 00:37:19.827
And your defenders?

00:37:21.167 --> 00:37:22.293
All nullified.

00:37:23.602 --> 00:37:25.695
Thank you
for coming back for me.

00:37:25.738 --> 00:37:27.501
You put yourself at risk.

00:37:27.540 --> 00:37:28.507
And you, Chakotay,

00:37:28.541 --> 00:37:30.702
clashed beside us
against the Kradin

00:37:30.743 --> 00:37:33.177
though you're a stranger
to this sphere.

00:37:33.212 --> 00:37:35.305
I glimpsed you chancing
your days and nights

00:37:35.347 --> 00:37:36.837
to save Rafin from our nemesis.

00:37:36.882 --> 00:37:40.443
You tell the truth
when you name them beasts.

00:37:43.322 --> 00:37:46.553
What will you do
now that your men are gone?

00:37:46.592 --> 00:37:48.321
Join with the Fifth Contingent.

00:37:48.360 --> 00:37:50.225
They're trying
to free the villagers.

00:37:50.262 --> 00:37:52.389
It doesn't go brightly for them.

00:37:54.667 --> 00:37:56.191
I'll come with you.

00:37:56.235 --> 00:37:58.635
No. I'll bring you to command.

00:37:58.671 --> 00:38:00.502
You can signal your people.

00:38:00.539 --> 00:38:02.166
That can wait
till the soonafter.

00:38:02.208 --> 00:38:03.675
In the now...

00:38:03.709 --> 00:38:06.803
you need my help
to nullify the nemesis.

00:38:18.323 --> 00:38:22.020
Backwalk!
Backwalk!

00:38:23.161 --> 00:38:24.560
The nemesis is nearing!

00:38:24.596 --> 00:38:26.154
It's sharper to backwalk!

00:38:51.423 --> 00:38:52.481
Brone!

00:38:54.893 --> 00:38:56.190
Vori soldiers!

00:38:56.227 --> 00:38:58.218
You are surrounded.

00:38:58.263 --> 00:39:00.561
Lay down your arms
and surrender.

00:39:05.103 --> 00:39:06.627
Hold your fire!

00:39:06.671 --> 00:39:08.696
You'll have to nullify me first!

00:39:10.508 --> 00:39:13.068
Hold your fire,
Commander Chakotay.

00:39:14.145 --> 00:39:16.238
Do not fire, Commander.

00:39:16.281 --> 00:39:17.680
How do you know my name?

00:39:17.715 --> 00:39:19.444
I am Lieutenant Tuvok.

00:39:19.484 --> 00:39:22.282
Tuvok?
Don't walk any closer.

00:39:23.354 --> 00:39:25.720
I've come to bring you
back to Voyager.

00:39:25.757 --> 00:39:26.883
Nullify him, Chakotay!

00:39:26.925 --> 00:39:28.586
It's a Kradin tactic.

00:39:28.626 --> 00:39:31.652
I assure you, Commander,
this is no ruse.

00:39:31.696 --> 00:39:33.027
It is Lieutenant Tuvok.

00:39:33.064 --> 00:39:34.463
Don't you recognize me?

00:39:36.868 --> 00:39:38.631
He's the nemesis!

00:39:39.637 --> 00:39:41.434
You're a Kradin beast.

00:39:41.473 --> 00:39:42.599
You destroyed that village,

00:39:42.640 --> 00:39:44.938
nullified Penno;
took away Karya.

00:39:44.976 --> 00:39:46.136
She was only a child!

00:39:46.177 --> 00:39:48.611
They've brainwashed you,
Commander.

00:39:48.646 --> 00:39:50.341
Look closer.

00:39:53.017 --> 00:39:54.484
Try to recall.

00:39:54.519 --> 00:39:56.384
Your shuttle was shot down.

00:39:56.421 --> 00:40:00.323
These people... the Vori...
they captured you.

00:40:00.358 --> 00:40:02.826
No. They rescued me.

00:40:02.861 --> 00:40:04.658
That is what they want you
to believe.

00:40:04.696 --> 00:40:07.961
But they have been
indoctrinating you, training you

00:40:08.066 --> 00:40:09.693
to fight their war.

00:40:09.734 --> 00:40:11.759
Take one more step
and I'll nullify you.

00:40:13.638 --> 00:40:17.074
You are Commander Chakotay
of the Starship Voyager.

00:40:17.108 --> 00:40:18.769
You are a scientist,

00:40:18.810 --> 00:40:20.175
an explorer.

00:40:20.211 --> 00:40:22.679
You are not a killer.

00:40:27.418 --> 00:40:28.976
Tuvok.

00:40:29.020 --> 00:40:30.510
Yes, Commander.

00:40:32.390 --> 00:40:33.982
How can you wear those colors?

00:40:34.058 --> 00:40:36.185
The Kradin...

00:40:36.227 --> 00:40:38.718
they're beasts, murderers.

00:40:38.763 --> 00:40:40.424
On the contrary...

00:40:40.465 --> 00:40:42.763
they are the ones
who helped us locate you.

00:40:42.800 --> 00:40:45.462
We tracked you
to a Vori training camp.

00:40:45.503 --> 00:40:48.438
We infiltrated the facility,
but you were gone.

00:40:48.473 --> 00:40:50.304
They had already
brought you here

00:40:50.341 --> 00:40:51.569
to fight this battle.

00:40:51.609 --> 00:40:55.306
Before today, nothing you
experienced here was real.

00:40:55.346 --> 00:40:59.305
It is the method the Vori use
to conscript and train soldiers.

00:40:59.350 --> 00:41:00.817
I don't believe you!

00:41:00.852 --> 00:41:04.583
I will prove it to you
if you will lower your weapon.

00:41:34.819 --> 00:41:36.878
Do you recognize this place?

00:41:39.624 --> 00:41:41.148
It's Larhana settlement.

00:41:56.674 --> 00:41:58.437
A defender.

00:41:58.476 --> 00:42:01.877
Mark, neighbors!
A defender.

00:42:04.349 --> 00:42:05.543
Defender.

00:42:05.583 --> 00:42:06.743
Karya.

00:42:09.587 --> 00:42:12.522
Welcome to Larhana settlement,
gloried defender.

00:42:14.192 --> 00:42:15.625
You're brightly greeted.

00:42:26.638 --> 00:42:30.301
Captain's Log, Stardate 51096.5.

00:42:30.341 --> 00:42:32.309
Although Lieutenant Tuvok
has managed

00:42:32.343 --> 00:42:35.403
to bring Commander Chakotay
safely back to the ship,

00:42:35.446 --> 00:42:36.811
it may be some time

00:42:36.848 --> 00:42:40.579
before his psychological wounds
are fully healed.

00:42:40.618 --> 00:42:42.347
My guess is the Vori used

00:42:42.387 --> 00:42:44.514
a combination
of mind control techniques,

00:42:44.555 --> 00:42:47.422
including
photometric projections,

00:42:47.458 --> 00:42:48.948
heightened emotional stimuli

00:42:48.993 --> 00:42:51.860
and highly sophisticated
psychotropic manipulation.

00:42:51.896 --> 00:42:54.126
From the condition
of your hypothalamus,

00:42:54.165 --> 00:42:55.792
I'd say they had you
so mixed up

00:42:55.833 --> 00:42:58.358
they could have convinced you
your own mother was a turnip.

00:42:59.971 --> 00:43:02.838
Everything I experienced
was some sort of simulation?

00:43:02.874 --> 00:43:04.535
Except for the battle
you were fighting

00:43:04.575 --> 00:43:05.542
when Tuvok found you.

00:43:05.576 --> 00:43:09.034
Apparently, attacking
the simulated commandant

00:43:09.080 --> 00:43:11.878
marked your graduation
from basic training.

00:43:11.916 --> 00:43:13.713
And the men I fought beside...

00:43:13.751 --> 00:43:15.309
none of them was real?

00:43:15.353 --> 00:43:17.651
Namon and Rafin weren't killed
in front of me?

00:43:17.689 --> 00:43:20.283
As far as we can tell, they
were part of the simulation.

00:43:20.325 --> 00:43:21.656
The idea was to make you bond

00:43:21.693 --> 00:43:24.457
with your fellow soldiers
as well as the villagers,

00:43:24.495 --> 00:43:26.486
so their deaths
would enrage you.

00:43:29.734 --> 00:43:31.429
Why me?

00:43:31.469 --> 00:43:33.403
Luck of the draw.

00:43:33.438 --> 00:43:35.303
You happened to be
passing through their space

00:43:35.340 --> 00:43:37.467
and you were as promising
a recruit as anyone else.

00:43:37.508 --> 00:43:39.237
We've been told
the Vori have dozens

00:43:39.277 --> 00:43:40.642
of these training facilities

00:43:40.678 --> 00:43:42.976
where they conscript
their own people

00:43:43.014 --> 00:43:44.982
and any aliens
they're able to capture.

00:43:45.016 --> 00:43:47.507
In short, Commander,
you've been subjected

00:43:47.552 --> 00:43:50.214
to a highly sophisticated form
of propaganda.

00:43:51.456 --> 00:43:53.981
Then the Kradin don't kill
innocent civilians?

00:43:54.058 --> 00:43:56.390
They don't desecrate
the Vori's dead?

00:43:56.427 --> 00:43:58.793
I don't know.

00:43:58.830 --> 00:44:02.664
But the Kradin accuse the Vori
of the same kinds of atrocities.

00:44:02.700 --> 00:44:06.466
I cared about the Vori,
but I hated the Kradin.

00:44:06.504 --> 00:44:08.438
I wanted to kill
every one of them.

00:44:08.473 --> 00:44:10.703
Evidently, that was the point.

00:44:11.776 --> 00:44:12.743
Captain.

00:44:12.777 --> 00:44:13.937
Ambassador Treen would like

00:44:14.011 --> 00:44:15.603
to have a word
with the Commander.

00:44:15.646 --> 00:44:18.581
I wish to tell you how pleased

00:44:18.616 --> 00:44:21.517
our people are
to hear of your recovery.

00:44:21.552 --> 00:44:23.247
I'm only sorry we weren't able

00:44:23.287 --> 00:44:25.448
to rescue you sooner
from our nemesis.

00:44:31.496 --> 00:44:33.521
Have I said something wrong?

00:44:33.564 --> 00:44:35.464
I don't know.

00:44:36.701 --> 00:44:38.566
If you'll excuse me, Captain.

00:44:45.810 --> 00:44:47.141
Chakotay?

00:44:52.116 --> 00:44:54.812
I wish it were as
easy to stop hating

00:44:54.852 --> 00:44:56.752
as it was to start.
